^{:go/end 157} (go/method sendLimit "sendLimit reports whether sending is possible at this time.\nWhen sending is pacing limited, it returns the next time a packet may be sent.\n" [^{:tag (* lossState)} c ^time/Time now] :results [^ccLimit limit ^time/Time next]
